/* 朋友圈彻底去小三角 + 评论区/被回复人名字全变纯白 */

/* 彻底隐藏顶部小三角伪元素（全维度定位精准清理） */
.nj-moments-engagement::before,
.nj-moments-engagement::after,
.nj-moments-likes::before,
.nj-moments-likes::after,
.nj-moments-comment::before,
.nj-moments-comment::after,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-engagement::before,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-engagement::after,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-likes::before,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-likes::after,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-comment::before,
#messaging-moments-tab .nj-moments-comment::after,
#messaging-moments-tab [class*="arrow"],
#messaging-moments-tab [class*="triangle"] {
  display: none !important;
  opacity: 0 !important;
  visibility: hidden !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-color: transparent !important;
  width: 0 !important;
  height: 0 !important;
}

