/*⁣⁠‍​‍​⁠​‌‌‌​‌‌⁠⁠‍​​⁠​⁠​⁠⁠‌‍​⁠‌​⁠⁠​⁠⁠‍‍⁠‌‌‌‍⁠​⁠​​‍​​​⁠⁠​​‍‍‍⁠⁠⁠​‌⁠⁣ =====================================================
   世界书 · 自动跟随系统日夜间切换版（银白灰高级感）
   修复：顶栏圆形图标、日间详情页按钮、日间列表视图卡片
   ===================================================== */

/* ==================== 01. 基础布局与尺寸（日夜间共用） ==================== */
:root {
    --wb-book-w: calc((100% - 16px) / 3);
    --wb-book-h: 190px;
    --wb-book-tilt: 0deg;
    --wb-book-lean-gap: 0px;
}

/* 书架网格与三列布局 */
.wb-books-row {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important;
    align-items: stretch !important;
    justify-items: stretch !important;
    gap: 14px 8px !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    padding: 12px 0 !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
}

/* 隐藏书柜背景、摆设、装饰等不需要的元素 */
.wb-shelf-backing,
.wb-shelf-board,
.wb-books-row::before,
.wb-shelf-decor,
.wb-spine-bottom-shadow,
.wb-leaning-cast-shadow,
.wb-stacked-base-shadow,
.wb-faceout-stand,
.wb-faceout-shadow,
.wb-spine-obi,
.wb-spine-ribbon,
.wb-spine-tassel,
.wb-spine-global-pin,
.wb-spine-icon-anchor,
.wb-stacked-book.bottom,
.wb-spine-footer-number,
.wb-list-count,
.wb-spine-footer-number *,
.wb-spine-obi,
.wb-spine-ribbon,
.wb-spine-tassel,
.wb-spine-global-pin,
.wb-list-grip,
.wb-list-check {
    display: none !important;
}

/* 每本书统一为长方形卡片 */
.wb-book-unit,
.wb-leaning-wrapper,
.wb-unit-leaning,
.wb-unit-stacked,
.wb-unit-faceout {
    display: block !important;
    position: relative !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    height: var(--wb-book-h) !important;
    min-height: var(--wb-book-h) !important;
    max-height: var(--wb-book-h) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    transform: none !important;
    rotate: none !important;
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb !important;
    border-radius: 13px !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
}

.wb-unit-leaning,
.wb-unit-stacked,
.wb-unit-faceout {
    --wb-book-tilt: 0deg !important;
    --wb-book-lean-gap: 0px !important;
}

/* 封面图铺满卡片 */
.wb-book-spine-body,
.wb-stacked-book.top,
.wb-faceout-cover {
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    display: block !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    min-height: 100% !important;
    max-height: 100% !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    transform: none !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-radius: 12px !important;
    background-size: cover !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}

/* 封面底部暗色渐变，用于让书名在图片上更清晰 */
.wb-book-spine-body::after,
.wb-stacked-book.top::after,
.wb-faceout-cover::after {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    z-index: 1 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
    background: linear-gradient(
        to top,
        rgba(0,0,0,.86) 0%,
        rgba(0,0,0,.35) 32%,
        transparent 67%
    ) !important;
}

/* 书名底部银白色标题带 */
.wb-spine-title-container,
.wb-stacked-title,
.wb-faceout-title {
    position: absolute !important;
    top: auto !important;
    bottom: 0 !important;
    left: 0 !important;
    right: 0 !important;
    display: -webkit-box !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: auto !important;
    max-height: 3.3em !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 7px 4px !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    white-space: normal !important;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere !important;
    word-break: break-word !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical !important;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2 !important;
    color: #edf1f6 !important;
    background: rgba(15,15,17,.9) !important;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(235,239,245,.28) !important;
    border-bottom: none !important;
    border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
    font-weight: 650 !important;
    line-height: 1.4 !important;
    letter-spacing: .1px !important;
